    "description": "Instead of providing a user with the new reference frame LV95 in a classical manner with site descriptions and coordinates, it is also conceivable to provide LV95 using permanent and stable GPS stations. The result of this approach was the Automated GNSS Network for Switzerland (AGNES).",
